<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weders</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuversicheren</unclear>, oder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zucontentieren</unclear>, dar-
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> aber ihnen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">biß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dato</unclear> (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unangesehen</unclear> sie
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eins</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oder</unclear> das annder mit verlangen ge-
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wartet</unclear>.) <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verkündt</unclear> worden, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dero</unclear>-
<lb n="27"/>wegen sie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verursacht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seÿen</unclear>, sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beÿ</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear>
<lb n="28"/>der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">obrigkeit</unclear> auch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zubeklagen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> gehorsam-
<lb n="29"/>men <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pitten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wollten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihrent</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halben</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">intercedendo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freündt</unclear>- <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüdtgnoßisch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersuchen</unclear>
<lb n="31"/>und bitten, die oberkeitliche verordnung
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2623_10178.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuthun</unclear>, daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesagter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wider</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sie</unclear> die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unsrige</unclear>
<lb n="33"/>eben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sowol</unclear>, als anndere seine Creditoren eint-
<lb n="34"/>weders bezahle oder nebendt andren auch ver-
<lb n="35"/>sichere.
<lb n="36"/>Wann dann wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ihr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ansuochen</unclear> der billich-
<lb n="37"/>keit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungemaeß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befunden</unclear>, haben wir dem-
<lb n="38"/>selben umb soviel mehr statt geben, und Eüch
<lb n="39"/>hiemit freündtlich Eydtgnoessisch ersuchen woellen,
<lb n="40"/>den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unsrigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">orts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ebemmaessig</unclear> zu dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ihren</unclear>,
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">günstig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Oberkeitlich</unclear>
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verholffen</unclear> zu sein. Wie unß nun daran nit
<lb n="43"/>zweiflet, Ihr ohne das einen Jeden zur aller
<lb n="44"/>billichkeit zubefürdren geneigt sein werden,
<lb n="45"/>Alß begeren wir es auch zu allen fürfallenden
<lb n="46"/>occasionen mit freündt Eydtgnoessischem willen
<lb n="47"/>unbeschwaert zuerwidren. Unß damit beid-
<lb n="48"/>seits dem lieben Gott <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolbefehlende</unclear>. <origDate when="1627" resp="#ner">Datum den
